# Environment — saymd landing (Vercel / saymd-app repo)

Copy to Vercel project env on **saymd-app** (separate Stripe account — see docs/STRIPE_SAYMD.md).

```bash
SAYMD_PUBLIC=0                        # 1 = site visible to everyone (launch day)
SAYMD_PREVIEW_TOKEN=                  # long random string; unlock via /?preview=TOKEN
SAYMD_SALES_ENABLED=0                 # 1 = Stripe checkout buttons work
SAYMD_SITE_URL=https://saymd.app
STRIPE_SECRET_KEY=                    # saymd Stripe account only — NOT VCL
STRIPE_SAYMD_PRO_ANNUAL_PRICE_ID=
STRIPE_SAYMD_PRO_MONTHLY_PRICE_ID=
STRIPE_SAYMD_WEBHOOK_SECRET=
STRIPE_SAYMD_BILLING_PORTAL_URL=      # Stripe Customer Portal login page (billing.stripe.com/p/login/…)
SAYMD_LICENSE_PRIVATE_KEY_DER_B64=
DATABASE_URL=                         # Neon — license storage (required for success page)
```

Stripe Dashboard (saymd account) → Business settings:
- Privacy: `https://saymd.app/privacy.html`
- Terms: `https://saymd.app/terms.html`
- Support: `support@saymd.app`

Generate keypair: `npm run generate-keys -w @saymd/pro` — embed public in Pro package, private in Vercel only.
